cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. License decision pending (see LICENSE)."
type: software
title: "AI-CLS: AI-supported interactive platform for teaching Calculus (Temel Analiz)"
abstract: >-
  Web platform combining handwriting recognition (OCR to LaTeX), Turkish speech recognition
  (ASR), a rule-based Turkish text-to-command layer, a LaTeX-to-SymPy parser and a deterministic
  computer algebra core (SymPy) with textbook knowledge-graph integration, developed under
  TÜBİTAK 1001 project 125E748.
version: 0.1.0.dev0
date-released: "2026-09-07"
